    {
      "source": "Synchronous, <strong>blocking</strong> call returns once the <a href=\"Subscription.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.stream\"><code>Subscription</code></a> becomes <a href=\"#isActive()\"><code>active</code></a> or <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/Duration.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>timeout</code></a> exceeds.",
      "translation": "同步的、<strong>阻塞式</strong> 调用会在 <a href=\"Subscription.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.stream\"><code>Subscription</code></a> 变为 <a href=\"#isActive()\"><code>active</code></a> 或 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/Duration.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>timeout</code></a> 超时时返回。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Due to the asynchronous nature of the <a href=\"Task.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.stream\"><code>Task</code></a> execution a <a href=\"Subscription.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.stream\"><code>Subscription</code></a> might not immediately become\nactive. <a href=\"#isActive()\"><code>isActive()</code></a> provides an answer if the underlying <a href=\"Task.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.stream\"><code>Task</code></a> is already running.",
      "translation": "由于 `<a href=\"Task.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.stream 中的接口\"><code>Task</code></a>` 的执行是异步的，因此 `<a href=\"Subscription.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.stream 中的接口\"><code>Subscription</code></a>` 可能不会立即变为活动状态。<a href=\"#isActive()\"><code>isActive()</code></a> 可用于判断底层的 `<a href=\"Task.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.stream 中的接口\"><code>Task</code></a>` 是否已经在运行。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
