      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>true</code> if the subscription was activated. <code>false</code> if the waiting time elapsed before task was\n        activated.",
      "translation": "如果订阅已激活，则返回 <code>true</code>；如果在任务激活前等待时间已过，则返回 <code>false</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/InterruptedException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">InterruptedException</a></code> - if the current thread is interrupted while waiting.",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/InterruptedException.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\">InterruptedException</a></code> - 如果在等待时当前线程被中断。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>timeout</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>timeout</code> 不能为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Mark Paluch",
      "translation": "马克·帕卢赫",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "true if the subscription is currently executed.",
      "translation": "如果当前正在执行订阅，则为 true。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The <a href=\"Subscription.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.stream\"><code>Subscription</code></a> is the link to the actual running <a href=\"Task.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.stream\"><code>Task</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"Subscription.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.stream 中的接口\"><code>Subscription</code></a> 是连接到实际运行的 <a href=\"Task.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.stream 中的接口\"><code>Task</code></a> 的链接。",
      "count": 1
    }
